---
title: "To Do list – flown"
---

extends /_/layouts/default

block body
  article.pbs3
    :md
       These flags do not yet meet the criteria for inclusion in the project:
       - The file size must be less than 10kb
       - All colour must be applied using `fill` (no strokes or gradients)
       - Only `<svg>`, `<path>`, `<defs>`, `<use>` and `<circle>` tags are permitted
       - Dimensions are 1200 &times; 720 (excepting [Switzerland], [Nepal] and [Vatican City])

       [Switzerland]: /flags/ch
       [Nepal]: /flags/np
       [Vatican City]: /flags/va

  .flags.pb3(style="border-block-start-width: 1px")
    p
      small There are #{invalid.length} invalid flags remaining in this list.

    ul.gr2.mbs3(style="gap: 1rem")
      each flag in invalid
        +flag-list-item(flag)